## 1. License Summary

The Productside Playbook and Skills Library is licensed under the **Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 4.0 International License**, with additional permissions for internal business use as described below.

This means you may use, copy, adapt, and share these materials, provided you follow the terms of this license.

Our intent is simple:

> Use these materials to help you do better product work.
> Do not sell, package, embed, or commercialize the materials themselves without written permission from Productside.

